@startuml Actual Frontend Flow - Contract-Aware (WORKS!)
!theme plain
title <font size=24 color="#2E7D32"><b>ACTUAL FRONTEND FLOW: Contract-Aware (Works Correctly!)</b></font>\n<font size=14 color="#388E3C">Event-driven architecture IS implemented in frontend</font>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor<<controller>> #E3F2FD
    BackgroundColor<<handler>> #C8E6C9
    BackgroundColor<<contract>> #FFF9C4
    BackgroundColor<<stripe>> #FFCDD2
}

box "Controller Layer" #E3F2FD
    participant "StripeOrderController" as SOC <<controller>>
end box

box "Event Handlers (Priority Order)" #C8E6C9
    participant "StripeContractCreationHandler\n(priority: 100)" as CCH <<handler>>
    participant "StripeCheckoutSessionHandler\n(priority: 0)" as CSH <<handler>>
    participant "StripeCheckoutReturnHandler" as CRH <<handler>>
    participant "PaymentAuthorizedEventHandler" as PAH <<handler>>
    participant "StripeOrderCreationHandler" as OCH <<handler>>
end box

box "Contract Layer" #FFF9C4
    participant "ContractService" as CS <<contract>>
    participant "ContractRepository" as CR <<contract>>
    participant "PaymentContract" as PC <<contract>>
end box

box "External" #FFCDD2
    participant "Stripe API" as SA <<stripe>>
end box

== Phase 1: Create Checkout Session (Frontend) ==

SOC -> SOC : createCheckoutSession()
activate SOC #90CAF9

SOC -> CCH : dispatch(StripeCheckoutSessionRequestEvent)
activate CCH #A5D6A7

note right of CCH #C8E6C9
  **Contract Created!**
  state = DRAFT
end note

CCH -> CS : createContract(userId, basket, conditionTypes)
activate CS
CS -> CR : save(contract)
CR --> CS : contract (DRAFT)
CS --> CCH : PaymentContract
deactivate CS

CCH -> CCH : storeDeliveryAddressHash()
CCH -> CCH : storeSecurityMetadata()
CCH -> CR : save(contract)
CCH --> SOC : context.setContract(contract)
deactivate CCH

SOC -> CSH : handle(event) [priority: 0]
activate CSH #81C784

CSH -> SA : checkout.sessions.create()
SA --> CSH : CheckoutSession {id, url}

note right of CSH #FFF9C4
  **Provider Info Stored!**
  contract.OXPROVIDERORDERID = 'cs_xxx'
end note

CSH -> CR : save(contract)
CSH --> SOC : context.set('checkoutUrl')
deactivate CSH

SOC --> SOC : Return JSON {url, contract_id}
deactivate SOC

== Phase 2: Customer Pays on Stripe ==

note over SA #FFCDD2
  Customer completes payment
  Stripe redirects to success_url
end note

== Phase 3: Return from Stripe ==

SOC -> CRH : dispatch(StripeCheckoutReturnEvent)
activate CRH #FFA726

CRH -> SA : sessions.retrieve(sessionId)
SA --> CRH : {payment_status: 'paid'}

CRH -> CR : findById(contract_id)
CR --> CRH : PaymentContract

note right of CRH #C8E6C9
  **Contract Loaded & Validated!**
  Token validated
  Security check passed
end note

CRH -> CRH : restoreDeliveryAddressHash()

CRH -> PAH : dispatch(PaymentAuthorizedEvent)
activate PAH #FF9800

note right of PAH #FFF9C4
  **State Transition!**
  DRAFT -> PENDING
  Condition fulfilled
end note

PAH -> PC : transitionToPending()
PAH -> PC : fulfillCondition('payment_authorized')
PAH -> PC : setProvider('stripe', pi_xxx)
PAH -> CR : save(contract)

alt All conditions fulfilled
    note right of PAH #C8E6C9
      **PENDING -> READY_TO_COMMIT**
    end note

    PAH -> OCH : dispatch(ContractReadyToCommitEvent)
    activate OCH #FF5722

    note right of OCH #FFF9C4
      **Order Created!**
      state -> COMMITTED
    end note

    OCH -> OCH : createOrder()
    OCH -> PC : commitToOrder(orderId)
    OCH -> CR : save(contract)

    OCH --> PAH : context.set('orderId')
    deactivate OCH
end

PAH --> CRH : done
deactivate PAH

CRH --> SOC : redirectTarget = 'thankyou'
deactivate CRH

== Contract State at End of Frontend Flow ==

note over PC #FFF9C4
  <font color="#E65100"><b>CONTRACT STATE: COMMITTED</b></font>
  - Order exists in oxorder
  - OXTRANSID = 'pi_xxx'
  - Contract knows order ID
  - Awaiting webhook for FULFILLED
end note

legend bottom
  |= Phase |= Contract State |= What Happens |
  | Create Session | DRAFT | Contract created, provider info stored |
  | Customer Pays | DRAFT | (No change - external) |
  | Return Handler | PENDING | Payment authorized, condition fulfilled |
  | Order Creation | COMMITTED | Order created, bound to contract |

  <font color="#2E7D32"><b>FRONTEND FLOW WORKS CORRECTLY!</b></font>
  Event system and contract state machine ARE used.
  The problem is webhook flow doesn't continue this pattern.
endlegend

@enduml
